      "description": "The Azrael, named for the angel of death, is the Liberty Rogues' laser: a Justice pushed past its limits, hitting harder and drinking more power. Rogue pilots never worry about the bill.\n\nAn Assault gun: a shield gun. It hits a shield in full and a bare hull at 50 %, so it strips shields fast and leaves the hull to a heavier gun. Quick, accurate bolts, cheap on energy: the gun everyone starts with. Full damage out to 75 % of its range, falling to 50 % at the end of it. Made for light fighters and for learning to aim.",
      "images": [
        "images/wiki/weapons/azrael-model.webp"
      ],
      "source": "27a255b5a0cb",
