      ],
      "description": "The CP-a Stunpulse was built to stop a ship, not destroy it. Police use it to hold smugglers for inspection, and pirates use it to hold traders for their cargo.\n\nAn EMP gun: little damage, but every hit drains the target's power. Drained dry, a ship is jammed for 1.5 seconds, renewed by every hit: no afterburner and no cruise, so it cannot run. Each shot takes 50 % more energy than a lighter gun's. Fly it next to a gun that does the killing.",
