      "description": "The Xenos want every trader out of Liberty, and the Tarantula is how they say it. It waits like its namesake and bites hardest on a ship that never thought to fight. Bounty Hunters who bring one in get paid twice: once for the pilot, once for the gun.\n\nA Heavy gun: a hull gun. Slow, big bolts that tear a bare hull in full but do only 50 % against a shield that is up, so break the shield first. Full damage only out to 50 % of its range, falling to 50 % at the end of it: get close. Each shot takes 50 % more energy than a lighter gun's. Made for heavy fighters.\n\nA faction's signature gun, the best of its line. No dealer sells it; only these ships' wrecks drop it: Xenos",
