      "description": "The Rogues named their best gun after the demon who finds what is hidden. A Vassago is made for the ship that never saw it coming and hits hardest on one that is not firing back. Rogue workshops build them from Azraels taken off the dead.\n\nAn Assault gun: a shield gun. It hits a shield in full and a bare hull at 50 %, so it strips shields fast and leaves the hull to a heavier gun. Quick, accurate bolts, cheap on energy: the gun everyone starts with. Full damage out to 75 % of its range, falling to 50 % at the end of it. Made for light fighters and for learning to aim.\n\nA faction's signature gun, the best of its line. No dealer sells it; only these ships' wrecks drop it: Liberty Rogues",
