      "description": "Every Liberty pilot learns to fly behind a Justice. The Navy keeps the line's last mark for itself: the Vengeance, finished by Navy armourers to tolerances no dealer could pay for, puts the same bolt out on far less power. Whoever flies one serves in Liberty's forces, or took it from someone who did.\n\nAn Assault gun: a shield gun. It hits a shield in full and a bare hull at 50 %, so it strips shields fast and leaves the hull to a heavier gun. Quick, accurate bolts, cheap on energy: the gun everyone starts with. Full damage out to 75 % of its range, falling to 50 % at the end of it. Made for light fighters and for learning to aim.\n\nA faction's signature gun, the best of its line. No dealer sells it; only these ships' wrecks drop it: Liberty Navy  ·  Liberty Security Force  ·  Liberty Police, Inc.",
